@TallerMecanico_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Clientes
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Accept: application/json

### Buscar clientes
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/clientes?buscar=Jorge
Accept: application/json

### Vehiculos
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos
Accept: application/json

### Filtro por marca
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos?marca=Toyota
Accept: application/json

### Ruta anidada
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/1/vehiculos
Accept: application/json

### Recurso inexistente
GET {{TallerMecanico_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos/2147483647
Accept: application/json
